    {
      "id": "cr_a3000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "type": "job",
      "kind": "recovery",
      "name": "The quiet beacon",
      "summary": "Go out to the second belt and find out why a claim beacon stopped.",
      "details": "The claims office will clear a claim whose beacon is silent long enough. Doran Vey wants a crew to reach his claim first, see what happened, and bring back the beacon log. Ilse Marrow will pay the same crew to bring back a sealed case she says is hers, and she asks them not to tell Doran.",
      "tags": [
        "example"
      ],
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "system",
